  "body": "Nestled in one of East Aucklands most sought after neighbourhoods, this cosy family home offers the perfect blend of comfort and convenience. Positioned within easy walking distance of Pigeon Mountain Primary, Bucklands Beach Intermediate, and the prestigious Macleans College, this is a location families dream of securing.\r\n\r\nDesigned to embrace its prized north-facing aspect, the home is filled with natural light and boasts generous, sun-soaked living spaces. The formal lounge, modernised kitchen, and open-plan family areas flow effortlessly together, creating the perfect environment for everyday living and entertaining. Step outside to your own entertainers backyard featuring an inground swimming pool and an inviting barbecue area for summer celebrations.\r\n\r\nThoughtfully configured to accommodate growing or extended families, this home offers two spacious ensuite bedrooms on both the upper and lower levels, complete with walk-in wardrobes and ample storage. A separate wing with three additional bedrooms provides flexibility for teenagers, guests, a home office, studio, or playroom.\r\n\r\nConstructed from enduring brick and weatherboard, with double glazing throughout, this well located residence enjoys peaceful, elevated views towards Rangitoto Island. Surrounded by greenery and privacy, it delivers a tranquil lifestyle without compromising on convenience.\r\n\r\nJust a short stroll or drive away, Half Moon Bay Marina offers an exceptional range of amenities, including waterfront dining, supermarkets, pharmacies, daycare facilities, parks, reserves, and the ferry terminal - providing easy access to Waiheke Island and Auckland CBD.\r\n\r\nOpportunities like this are rarely available in the heart of Macleans. With motivated vendors committed to a sale, now is the time to secure your family's future in this exceptional home.",
